OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA windy day across the north,
OL,6,Fespecially northwest Scotland with
OL,7,Fsevere gales here. Dry and bright for
OL,8,Fmost, with the best of the sunshine
OL,9,Ftowards the south. Skies clouding over
OL,10,Fin the northwest, with patchy rain
OL,11,Facross Scotland. Rather warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain and brisk winds
OL,14,Fmoving southeastwards across Scotland
OL,15,Fand Northern Ireland, with clear
OL,16,Fspells and showers following. Dry for
OL,17,Fmuch of England and Wales, with
OL,18,Fvariable cloud. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
