OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain moving slowly southeast
OL,6,Facross northern England into Wales,
OL,7,Freaching central areas later. Warm
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells in the southeast.
OL,9,FFresher with showers in the northwest.
OL,10,FWinds gradually easing.
